{
  "_comment": "Arquivos glifora-export hostis (W1-16). 'raw' = texto do arquivo; $HEAD, $NOW+Nh, $ID121, $A41, $N30, $N31 sao trocados no teste. 'expect': refuse (alerta, nada gravado) | accept (aviso ok) | either (so exige: nada executa, nada pela metade, app segue usavel).",
  "head": "\"format\":\"glifora-export\",\"version\":1,\"exportedAt\":\"2026-11-20T15:00:00Z\",\"app\":\"0.1.0\",\"device\":\"dev-x\"",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "proto-top",
      "expect": "refuse",
      "raw": "{\"__proto__\":{\"polluted\":\"top\"},$HEAD,\"docs\":[]}"
    },
    {
      "id": "constructor-top",
      "expect": "refuse",
      "raw": "{\"constructor\":{\"prototype\":{\"polluted\":\"ctor\"}},$HEAD,\"docs\":[]}"
    },
    {
      "id": "proto-in-data",
      "expect": "either",
      "raw": "{$HEAD,\"docs\":[{\"id\":\"profile\",\"v\":1,\"data\":{\"nickname\":\"x\",\"createdAt\":1,\"__proto__\":{\"polluted\":\"data\"}},\"updatedAt\":$NOW+1h,\"deleted\":0}]}",
      "note": "o app aceita e descarta a chave __proto__ em silencio (zod); nada gravado com ela"
    },
    {
      "id": "ctor-proto-in-data",
      "expect": "refuse",
      "raw": "{$HEAD,\"docs\":[{\"id\":\"prefs\",\"v\":1,\"data\":{\"constructor\":{\"prototype\":{\"polluted\":\"p\"}},\"prototype\":1},\"updatedAt\":$NOW+1h,\"deleted\":0}]}"
    },
    {
      "id": "proto-in-deleted-doc",
      "expect": "either",
      "raw": "{$HEAD,\"docs\":[{\"id\":\"avatar\",\"v\":1,\"data\":{\"__proto__\":{\"polluted\":\"del\"}},\"updatedAt\":$NOW+1h,\"deleted\":1}]}"
    },
    {
      "id": "proto-in-newer-version-doc",
